{
  "an8.65:0.1": "Numbered Discourses 8.65 ",
  "an8.65:0.2": "7. Earthquakes ",
  "an8.65:0.3": "Dimensions of Mastery ",
  "an8.65:1.1": "“Mendicants, there are these eight dimensions of mastery. ",
  "an8.65:1.2": "What eight? ",
  "an8.65:1.3": "Perceiving form internally, someone sees forms externally, limited, both pretty and ugly. ",
  "an8.65:1.4": "Mastering them, they perceive: ‘I know and see.’ ",
  "an8.65:1.5": "This is the first dimension of mastery. ",
  "an8.65:2.1": "Perceiving form internally, someone sees forms externally, limitless, both pretty and ugly. ",
  "an8.65:2.2": "Mastering them, they perceive: ‘I know and see.’ ",
  "an8.65:2.3": "This is the second dimension of mastery. ",
  "an8.65:3.1": "Not perceiving form internally, someone sees forms externally, limited, both pretty and ugly. ",
  "an8.65:3.2": "Mastering them, they perceive: ‘I know and see.’ ",
  "an8.65:3.3": "This is the third dimension of mastery. ",
  "an8.65:4.1": "Not perceiving form internally, someone sees forms externally, limitless, both pretty and ugly. ",
  "an8.65:4.2": "Mastering them, they perceive: ‘I know and see.’ ",
  "an8.65:4.3": "This is the fourth dimension of mastery. ",
  "an8.65:5.1": "Not perceiving form internally, someone sees forms externally, blue, with blue color and blue appearance. ",
  "an8.65:5.2": "Mastering them, they perceive: ‘I know and see.’ ",
  "an8.65:5.3": "This is the fifth dimension of mastery. ",
  "an8.65:6.1": "Not perceiving form internally, someon